# Figma to code

Follow `general.mdc` / `components.mdc` for layers, 70-line limit, utils, alt, a11y, motion.
Use skill `figma-to-code` and files under `.cursor/skills/figma-to-code/references/`.

## Do

- Call `get_design_context` with the node id before writing code.
- Treat MCP output (often React + Tailwind) as a reference, not final code.
- Map Auto Layout parents to flex/gap/padding; do not copy absolute `left`/`top` or Tailwind as-is.
- Reuse fonts and tokens from the repo after discover; do not default to Inter or MCP hex values.
- Map Figma library instances to existing UI primitives; do not invent primitives for pixel chasing.
- Download MCP asset URLs into the repo; do not hand-draw icon paths.
- Implement large screens section by section; validate with screenshot vs UI (`validate-against-figma`).
- Keep Figma-driven components within the 70-line `*.tsx` limit from `components.mdc`.

## Example flow

```text
1. get_design_context(nodeId)
2. discover UI/tokens/scale in repo
3. implement Feature section with SCSS Modules
4. compare screenshot to UI and adjust
```
